<title>USA: U.S. monthly steel mill product imports up in July.</title>
<headline>U.S. monthly steel mill product imports up in July.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. imports of steel mill products were 2,602,002 short tons in July, up 13.9 percent from the 2,285,328 short tons imported in June, the American Iron and Steel Institute said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The July figure was up from 1,895,049 short tons in the same month of last year, the institute said.</p>
<p>Of total July imports, finished products were 1,937,646 short tons, it said.</p>
<p>Exports were 379,506 short tons in July, down from 395,269 short tons in June and 685,632 in July last year.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8489</p>
</text>
